> Index = the Buildings type: 0 the player's warbase pad $2C (a crate), factories 1 electronics $28, 2 nuclear $25, 3 phasers $23, 4 missiles $20, 5 cannon $1D, 6 chassis $17 (each the robot part of its product, facing down: $16 + the parts table $D6C8), 7 and 8 the flags $2A and $2B. In the deep recording at frame 20000 the type 7 / 8 records stand two columns left of a factory (four of the player's warbase pad): a factory's owner flag; 7 the player's, 8 the enemy's.
